  "title": "packet-rdm.c: Introduce dissector table for Manufacturer-Specific PIDs",
  "description": "Create a new dissector table for manufacturer-specific PIDs so they can be dissected by lua plugins.\n\nI also moved the current ETC manufacturer specific PIDs to a new file as it became it's own protocol.  \nThis involved duplicating a few things, so I'd be happy to move it back if that would be preferred.\n\nSample packet capture:\n\n[ETC_manf_pids_small.pcapng.gz](/uploads/9b42f93c8889776920169bfe3bf57761/ETC_manf_pids_small.pcapng.gz)\n\nSample Lua plugin:\n\n[rdm_manf.lua](/uploads/6191ba495a8a613f449e16d8329ecaac/rdm_manf.lua)\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
